<#-- A service file's doc (plans/archive/Autodoc.md): its services. The names: the doc's header and services; md is
     AutodocLib.js. -->
<#assign md = ec.resource.script("component://framework/template/autodoc/AutodocLib.js")>
# ${md.plain(title)}

${md.nav(up, rootHref)}

- **Service file:** ${md.defined(component, name, "")}

${description}

## Services

${services.length ? md.table(["Service", "Summary"], services.map((service) => [md.codeLink(service.title, service.href), md.plain(service.summary)])) : "None.\n"}
